Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:54.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 821.57 971.98 l 944.59 1062.63 1319.78 1064 1322.45 938.67)}{\q2}Questo racconto ha inizio 400 anni fa,
